   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>案例是这类系统唯一的「教材」。完井设计书与投产总结在采油厂本来就要归档，<strong>标注成本接近零</strong>；真正的工作量在把非结构化文档抽成结构化字段，并统一量纲与术语词典——出砂指数用什么单位、水层距以哪个基准面起算，每个字段都要有出处。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>储层与流体特征</span><span class='cl-s'>岩性、出砂指数、水层位置</span></span><span class='cl-n'>单区块 100—500 井次，作检索属性</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>完井方式与生产表现</span><span class='cl-s'>方式、初期产能、出砂情况</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为标签，投产后 6 个月回填</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>案例文本</span><span class='cl-s'>完井设计书与完井总结</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于知识抽取与理由追溯</span></div></div>"
